Previously only the subject link was clickable. Now the entire row navigates to ticket details.

## Changes

**Both `ticket-list.tsx` and `staff-ticket-list.tsx`:**
- Added `onClick` handler to `TableRow` with `router.push()` navigation
- Added keyboard support via `onKeyDown` (Enter/Space)
- Replaced `Link` component in subject cell with `span` to avoid nested interactive elements
- Added `tabIndex={0}`, `role="button"`, and `cursor-pointer` for accessibility

```tsx
<TableRow
  onClick={() => router.push(`/dashboard/tickets/${ticket.id}`)}
  onKeyDown={(e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {
      e.preventDefault()
      router.push(`/dashboard/tickets/${ticket.id}`)
    }
  }}
  tabIndex={0}
  role="button"
  className={cn('transition-colors cursor-pointer', ...)}
>
  <TableCell className="font-medium">
    <span className="hover:text-primary transition-colors block">
      {ticket.subject}
    </span>
  </TableCell>
  {/* ... other cells */}
</TableRow>
```

